{
  "id": "PPA-03",
  "title": "Calvin-Benson Cycle & Photorespiration",
  "subtitle": "Chloroplast carbon assimilation and peroxisome-mitochondria photorespiratory salvage flux",
  "caption": "The Calvin-Benson-Bassham (CBB) cycle and photorespiratory salvage pathway. RuBisCO catalyzes both the carboxylation of RuBP yielding 3-PGA and the oxygenation yielding 2-phosphoglycolate. The salvage pathway channels 2-PG through the chloroplast envelope to the peroxisome (GOX, GGAT) and mitochondrion (GDC complex, SHMT), recovering 75% of carbon as 3-PGA while releasing CO2 and NH3.",
  "species_anchor": "arabidopsis_thaliana",
